{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27558","headline":"酬武藴之乙丑之岁始见华发余自悲遂成继和 · 张祜","name":"酬武藴之乙丑之岁始见华发余自悲遂成继和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"贾生年尚少，华发近相侵。\n不是流光促，因缘别恨深。\n怜君成苦调，感我独长吟。\n岂料清秋日，星星共映簪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27558.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27558","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}